    <!-- The employee's own calls (client request, N41). docs/QOLLANMA.md
         promises transparency about what is recorded; this is that promise as
         a screen. The vocabulary matters here more than anywhere: *qayd
         etilgan* = the call is logged, *yozib olingan* = the audio exists. -->
