    <!-- ══ E2: continuing without a capability (UC-14) ══════════════════════
         A phone whose microphone the OEM blocks is a WORKING installation that
         logs calls without audio. Refusing to enrol it turns a
         degraded-but-useful install into no install at all. So every step can
         be passed — and what changes is what the person is told they give up.
         Never a hidden escape hatch. -->
    <string name="perm_continue_without">Bu ruxsatsiz davom etish</string>
    <string name="perm_cost_audio">Davom etsangiz: qo\'ng\'iroqlar baribir qayd etiladi — kim bilan, qachon, qancha vaqt. Faqat suhbat ovozi yozilmaydi.</string>
    <string name="perm_cost_blocked">Davom etsangiz: qo\'ng\'iroqlar qayd etilmaydi. Ilova o\'rnatiladi va administrator nima yetishmayotganini ko\'radi — keyinroq tuzatish mumkin.</string>
    <string name="perm_cost_none">Bu qadam majburiy emas.</string>

